        <p class="subtitle">No drilling and no landlord approval. A doorframe bar sets up in a few minutes in a doorway that can support it.</p>
      </header>
    </div>
    <article class="article">
      <div class="article-meta">
        <a href="/about/" class="author-link">
          <span class="author-avatar">DH</span>
          <span>DeadHangs Team</span>
        </a>
        <span class="meta-sep">·</span>
